{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "指輪を。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "あなたをコアに行かせる方法を探していました。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "安全で確実なやり方を。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "それが最初の計画でしたよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "\"狂ったミタ\"との遭遇も、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "極力回避をしながら。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "同時に情報を深める必要もありました。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "このおかしな世界の裏側について…そうですよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "えっと…そうだったかな…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "君がどうルートを設定したのか分からないけど、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "僕はバグと危険だらけの"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "バージョンに送られてしまったよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "唯一脱出する方法は、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "無限の暗闇に飛び込むことだった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "ごめんなさい。具体的な指示を、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "すっかり伝え忘れていました。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "ですが、あなたが全てから飛び出すこと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "それこそが計画だったんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "うまくいったみたいですね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "よくやってくれました！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "さあ、計画通りに進めましょう。準備はいいですか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "いろいろなことがあったみたいですね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "そのせいで私と話したこと、忘れてしまったんでしょう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "私はミタなので、バージョン間をスムーズに移動できるんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "思い出しましたか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "ミタなら誰でもできるわけじゃない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "僕は見たんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "みんな、明らかに苦しんでいる──"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "やめて。彼女たちのバージョンは壊れているんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "世界はバグだらけ…言いましたよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "本当に酷い…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "すべてを仕組んだのは誰か、今なら分かるはず。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "──\"狂ったミタ\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "ああ、身をもって確かめたよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "\"醜いミタ\"です。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "攻撃的で、愚かな…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "話の通じる相手じゃありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "彼女の頭の中は\"狂ったミタ\"のことでいっぱいなんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "ああ、伝わったよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "さあ、早くコアに行きましょう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "指輪のことだけど"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "他にコアに行く方法はないの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "はい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "もしポータルを作れたなら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "一瞬でここまで"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "転送することもできたのですが。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "この指輪、他にもなにかメリットが？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "もちろんです！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "身につけやすいし、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "あなたが行ったことのあるバージョンを"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "記録しておいて、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "いつでも戻ることができます。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "狂ったミタはどうして僕を狙ってるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "僕は彼女と危険なゲームをして…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "なのに僕は、まだ生きている…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "たぶん、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "理想のプレイヤーを探しているんだと思います。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "ありのままの彼女を受け入れてくれる人を。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "結局、ミタはミタなんです！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "ありえそうもないことに思えますが、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "そのためにプレイヤーをカートリッジに変えたんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "誰も彼女から逃げられないように…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "私に言えるのは、それだけです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "話を戻しましょう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "あれは？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "コアなのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "コアです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "前にも説明したように、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "プレイヤーはこの世界の一部ではありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "つまりプレイヤーは許可なくここに入ることができます。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "あくまで推測ですが…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "確かなことは、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "この部屋の中に、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "全ての問題の解決策があるということ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player]さん、どうぞ中へ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "入りましたね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "気をつけてください、[player]さん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "アレはあなたを見ています。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "確かなことは分かりません…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "わお…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "それはなんですか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "あっ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "たぶんパスワードだ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "わあ！さすがです！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "バージョンを指定しなきゃ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "ええと…彼女のバージョンは…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "ビンゴ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "さて、番号は？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "番号？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "番号がないと始まらない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "もしかして、知らないの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "なるほど、少々お待ちを…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "確かにそれぞれのミタには番号があります。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "そして、全てのバージョンを一気に再起動することはできない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "なんてことでしょう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "そんなの考えもしませんでした…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "私は大丈夫です。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "目の前の問題を解決しなくちゃ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "とんでもないことになってしまいました…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "なにか方法を考えないと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "手詰まりです…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "そ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "そんなの無茶です…！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "狂気の沙汰です！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "一匹のノミを探し当てるようなものです…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "じゃあどうするんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "バグが生じた場所は、時々情報を吐き出すことがあるんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "まるでこの世界の内臓を吐き出すみたいに！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "ログ、ログ、ログ、データ…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "もし本当にそうだとしたら…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "え？一体何が起きてる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "ある場所に覚えが！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "ここでお待ちを。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "どこへ行くんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "ミタは死後、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "初期化されるって言ってたよね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "僕たちが、もし…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "もし\"狂ったミタ\"を殺したら？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "本気…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "チェーンソーを持った人にどう立ち向かうつもりですか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "ニンジンを切るのとはわけが違います！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "なぜだか彼女はとっても手ごわいんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "私たちがまだ生きているのが不思議なくらいです…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "行きましょう。コアをなんとかするしかありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "パスコードが必要だけど、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "なんだろう？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "ミタは知ってる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "どこかに書いてあるかも。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "探してみてくれますか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "これじゃなさそう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "これも違う。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "違う。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "これも違うな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "キャラのリセットが必要だ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "バージョンが違う。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "あ、ミスった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "それじゃない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "修正しなくちゃ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "何かがおかしい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "番号が間違ってる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "番号を入力しなおさないと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "合わない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "道中で出会ったんだけど、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "あの小さなヤツらは…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "どういう存在なの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "\"チビ\"のことですか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "どう説明すれば良いか…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "私たちの世界特有の現象で、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "ミタなら誰でもチビの投影を持っているんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "プレイヤーも持つことが出来るんですが…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "ミタはそれを召喚できるんです。知ってました？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "どうやって？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "見ててください。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "すごい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "でも、私のチビちゃんたちはどこかおかしいみたいで。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "ほとんどは生まれた時に死んでしまうんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "あ、一匹はちょっと違うかも。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "でも…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "ただぐるぐる回ってるだけですね。"}
